OL,3,GNEWSAMy 'fit and healthy' son's heart
OL,4,Astopped for 15 minutes
OL,5,
OL,6,F"You don't think your fit and healthy
OL,7,F17-year-old son is going to have a
OL,8,Fcardiac arrest," said mum Melanie.
OL,10,FShe found her son Flynn collapsed on
OL,11,Fhis bedroom floor in the early hours of
OL,12,F2 April while he was studying for his
OL,13,FA-levels.
OL,15,FFlynn's heart had stopped for 15
OL,16,Fminutes, leaving his brain starved of
OL,17,Foxygen, and caused brain damage that
OL,18,Fleft him unable to walk and affected
OL,19,Fhis sight.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
